```Title: Failed Logons for Many Accounts from One Source (raw Windows Security events)```
```ATT&CK: T1110.003 | Severity: high | Sigma id: bcfe7244-3339-4a31-9467-01c3db407ff2```
```Data source: Windows Security EventCode 4625 (Splunk Add-on for Microsoft Windows). Change index to where your Security logs live.```
```False positives: Shared jump hosts, VDI or Citrix servers where many users mistype passwords; Vulnerability scanners with credentialed checks```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity high.```
index=wineventlog source IN ("XmlWinEventLog:Security", "WinEventLog:Security")
(EventCode=4625 NOT (IpAddress IN ("-", "127.0.0.1", "::1")))
| bin _time span=1h
| stats dc(TargetUserName) as value_count by _time IpAddress
| search value_count >= 10
